{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title","id":1082625,"title":"Why \"Dragon-Blooded- What Fire Has Wrought\" as the title?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-23T08:27:43-07:00","id":1082625,"title":"Why \"Dragon-Blooded- What Fire Has Wrought\" as the title?","content":"Seems strange considering it has the children of Daana'd in it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T08:57:09-07:00","id":1082637,"title":"","content":"Because the Realm itself is associated with fire. &quot;Scarlet&quot; Empress, Five &quot;Dragon&quot; Throne, it's the biggest exporter of Iron in the world, and because Fire is associated with iron-working, and &quot;What Water Has Shaped&quot; isn't nearly as punchy as far as titles go.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:00:11-07:00","id":1082639,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title#post1082625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seems strange considering it has the children of Daana'd in it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Doesn't seem strange at all. Fire seems very prone to receiving high, if not top billing when the classical elements get discussed. <br /> <br /> (The Water section of the Dungeon of Dorukan gets cut for budgetary reasons, but Fire is there. Even <i>Avatar: the Last <b>Air</b>bender</i> describes the <b>Fire</b> nation as the ones who changed everything and conquered most of the known world.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-23-2017, 12:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:05:35-07:00","id":1082643,"title":"","content":"Fire is the element most commonly associated with dragons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:09:02-07:00","id":1082645,"title":"","content":"Also the context of the full title, wrought seems to kind of be important. It to me elucidates ideas of crucibles, forges and strife, which fits an Exalt who's largest collection is an empire forged on war, empire and conquest.<br /> <br /> Or more blithely, it's fancy-sounding.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:13:56-07:00","id":1082648,"title":"","content":"You think maybe it has something to do with the Realm Defense Grid and all the hell it laid on the Fair Folk, etc? Or maybe the deal with Malfeas (possible deal) The SE made to gain control of it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:14:54-07:00","id":1082650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082643#post1082643\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fire is the element most commonly associated with dragons.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I can't claim to be an expert, but isn't that a purely Western/European convention? I thought in both China and Japan dragons were associated with water instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1564-shinjo","name":"Shinjo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:25:01-07:00","id":1082655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shinjo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082650#post1082650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I can't claim to be an expert, but isn't that a purely Western/European convention? I thought in both China and Japan dragons were associated with water instead.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hot water, actually; Dragons in Asian mythology are famous for breathing steam, fog, lightning and boiling water. Hence their association with Storms.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082645#post1082645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also the context of the full title, wrought seems to kind of be important. It to me elucidates ideas of crucibles, forges and strife, which fits an Exalt who's largest collection is an empire forged on war, empire and conquest.<br /> <br /> Or more blithely, it's fancy-sounding.<br /> <br /> And stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which connects with the Realm principally fueling those conquests on iron, for which it is famous, given its proximity to the Elemental Pole of Earth which in turn mirrors the relationship between the Realm and 19th Century Britain, as they say; Guns, Germs and Steel. The tools with which colonialism dominated the planet, much as The Realm does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:27:37-07:00","id":1082657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082648#post1082648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You think maybe it has something to do with the Realm Defense Grid and all the hell it laid on the Fair Folk, etc?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really, I'm thinking <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar353_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"353\" data-vbnamecard=\"353\">Blaque</a>'s guess is closer to the mark.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082648#post1082648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or maybe the deal with Malfeas (possible deal) The SE made to gain control of it?</div> </div> </div> </div>What does that have to do with it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:31:33-07:00","id":1082660,"title":"","content":"I have theories.<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dk01eeKMD_I\" data-code=\"dk01eeKMD_I\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/dk01eeKMD_I/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:32:20-07:00","id":1082661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082637#post1082637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">it's the biggest exporter of Iron in the world, and because Fire is associated with iron-working</div> </div> </div> </div>+1. At least for me, it evokes technological imperialism (arms and armor, siege weaponry, scorching the earth literally and metaphorically through over-exploitation and hedonistic consumption, the inexorable march of &quot;progress&quot; bringing &quot;civilization&quot; wherever it goes) as much as dragon imagery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">Bearer of the legacy of Trauma Bear<br /> Need a dice-roller? Check out <a href=\"http://bit.ly/dicemat\" target=\"_blank\">Dicemat</a>.</span>","edited":{"userid":43,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/43-fata-ku","user":"Fata-Ku","date":". 04-23-2017, 12:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/43-fata-ku","name":"Fata-Ku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar43_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:41:35-07:00","id":1082669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082637#post1082637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> it's the biggest exporter of Iron in the world, and because Fire is associated with iron-working</div> </div> </div> </div> Right, yes of course. As Nexus is the biggest manufacturer of iron products, I look forward to Nexus: What Fire Has Also Wrought coming soon.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not really, I'm thinking <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar353_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"353\" data-vbnamecard=\"353\">Blaque</a>'s guess is closer to the mark.</div> </div> </div> </div> I was just adding to his thought.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:43:58-07:00","id":1082671,"title":"","content":"I think it's just more expressive of how the dragonblooded have shaped the world with war and conquest, and they just picked the sort of cute elemental phrase for that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:54:54-07:00","id":1082674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082671#post1082671\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> and they just picked the sort of cute elemental phrase for that.</div> </div> </div> </div> Probably could have done so without using a cliche that excludes 4 aspects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:59:23-07:00","id":1082678,"title":"","content":"Fire is associated with trials, with testing, with the scourging away of impurities, with hardening and sharpening. Think about the phrase &quot;trial by fire.&quot; Think about the concept of crucibles. Think about &quot;Walk Through the Fire&quot; from the Buffy musical episode. Think of the One Ring forged in the fires of Mount Doom. Think about the phrase &quot;getting fired.&quot; Think about firing clay.<br /> <br /> &quot;What Fire Has Wrought,&quot; is a shorthand way of saying, &quot;what great hardship and conflict and strife and challenges overcome Have Wrought.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's short, it's poetic, and it also jives well with the elemental powers of the people who are the book's subject matter. All in all, a solid title.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":15}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T10:03:29-07:00","id":1082682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shinjo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082650#post1082650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I can't claim to be an expert, but isn't that a purely Western/European convention? I thought in both China and Japan dragons were associated with water instead.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You are correct. Even in Eastern and Northern Europe (as opposed to Western Europe), dragons were more historically seen as serpents associated with water and earth. As Arian Dynas indicated, they did have association with geothermal springs (the well Hvergelmir, where Nidhogg lies in Norse myth is a &quot;boiling&quot; spring for example, and Python was associated with a geothermal vent, the gases of which gave the Oracles of Delphi her visions).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T10:14:28-07:00","id":1082690,"title":"","content":"They should just do four alternative cover versions, one for caste. What Fire has Wrought. What Water has Flood. What Air has Scattered. What Wood has Built. What Earth has Crushed","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3087-wwhere","name":"wwhere","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T10:18:43-07:00","id":1082694,"title":"","content":"The fire metaphor is all over the place, man. It can stand for so many different, and sometimes contradictory, things: love and passion as well as hate, birth and nurture as well as destruction, safety as well as threat, the mark of progress and industry as well as the untamable rage and chaos of nature. Because the fire metaphor has so many possible referents, it's easy to throw in, because it's likely that anyone reading it will make <i>some</i> connection to it. That also makes it a rather useless metaphor, but it sounds good at least.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082674#post1082674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Probably could have done so without using a cliche that excludes 4 aspects.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, the fire metaphor is a cliche. That said, any metaphor developed in only a single line will have to rely on previous interpretations of it, which by necessity makes it cliche. Developing a strong metaphor takes longer than a title in all cases.<br /> <br /> Edit: That's not true, come to think of it. I guess I mean that sometimes, a cliche is what you want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 04-23-2017, 01:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T12:34:21-07:00","id":1082739,"title":"","content":"It's just an evocative title.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T13:32:46-07:00","id":1082755,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082674#post1082674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Probably could have done so without using a cliche that excludes 4 aspects.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno, can you think of one?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T14:42:58-07:00","id":1082775,"title":"","content":"&quot;What fire has wrought&quot; could also refer to the ursupation. &quot;The fires of rebellion&quot; is a common idiom, and a rebellion is what set the course of history that would eventually lead to the realm as we know it.<br /> <br /> It is a phrase that describes multiple aspects of dragoblooded existence and history and on top of that alludes to the central premise of exalted: that heroes will forge their own fate.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I thank the Devs for the great game of Exalted!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded","name":"BjornTheFellhanded","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12735_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"327"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T16:23:23-07:00","id":1082816,"title":"","content":"Didn't Holden frame it as referring to the Empress as a Fire Aspect? I seem to recall that from ages long ago...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T16:48:13-07:00","id":1082826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082816#post1082816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Didn't Holden frame it as referring to the Empress as a Fire Aspect? I seem to recall that from ages long ago...</div> </div> </div> </div>She was always nebulously intended to be a Fire Aspect, literally right up until her stats were published, at which point she was written up as an Earth Aspect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T17:07:19-07:00","id":1082836,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082669#post1082669\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Right, yes of course. As Nexus is the biggest manufacturer of iron products, I look forward to Nexus: What Fire Has Also Wrought coming soon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even if Venice and Istanbul both become known for the Alum trade, and thus the dyed fabric trade, Venice will be Venice because it's known for mercantilisim; Istanbul's going to be &quot;That city that Alum comes from&quot; because it defined it. (Note, Istanbul was not the city that provided much of the Alum trade for the mid Renaissance, it's just an example and the first Ottoman city I could have pop into my head without having to look it up.)<br /> <br /> But even if it *was* just about it's exports, my further point is that Iron is associated with industrialization, and therefore colonialism, and by extension, it's a reference to Guns, Germs and Steel: The Fate of Human Societies, a book about exactly that, and a seminal classic in terms of &quot;pop&quot; historical analysis texts, specifically recommended by the Devs to read previously, along with Seeing Like a State and Debt: The First Five Thousand Years.<br /> <br /> That and it just sounds neat. Along with what WOG said about trials by fire and strife. It works on like 6 levels.<br /> <br /> 1. Elemental Associations<br /> 2. References to Colonialism and a sly reference to Guns, Germs and Steel<br /> 3. A comment about being the product of war and strife.<br /> 4. A reference to its nature as being the &quot;Scarlet Empire&quot; with its red uniformed legionaries, Scarlet Empress and the like.<br /> 5. The associations of Fire and Dragons<br /> 6. A reference to the Realm being a massive iron producer<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082826#post1082826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She was always nebulously intended to be a Fire Aspect, literally right up until her stats were published, at which point she was written up as an Earth Aspect.</div> </div> </div> </div>I personally prefer it without comment.<br /> <br /> After all, RPG supplements should leave more open ended questions than they should answer them, unless, you know, they're going into specifics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":2442,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","user":"Arian Dynas","date":". 04-23-2017, 08:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T18:23:39-07:00","id":1082860,"title":"","content":"I was always a little surprised that the gameline waited so long to reveal the Empress' aspect. She's the most famous person in the entire world and there are lots and lots of stories written about her. It doesn't seem like the kind of thing that she would intentionally keep as a secret, so I'm sure most people in Creation are passingly familiar with what her Aspect is. It's not necessarily the sort of thing that <i>needs</i> to be written, but in light of 2nd editions, &quot;Explain everything into the ground,&quot; I was always a little surprised it never got mentioned until the (originally slated) final book in the gameline.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T18:53:00-07:00","id":1082869,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082836#post1082836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I personally prefer it without comment.<br /> <br /> After all, RPG supplements should leave more open ended questions than they should answer them, unless, you know, they're going into specifics.</div> </div> </div> </div>That only makes sense if people in-setting aren't supposed to know what the Empress's Aspect is. But even if that's case it needs to be addressed that it is strangely not spoken of in-setting. She's the most famous person in the entire world and the blood ancestor of every Great House - it's bizarre that people wouldn't know.<br /> <br /> Same by the way with her name. It's fine if it's a secret in-setting, but that fact should be mentioned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T19:10:54-07:00","id":1082871,"title":"","content":"My gathering is that it's a bit of customization. It's not a secret, but it's a detail that ultimately is irrelevant since she's gone and whatever you want it to be if you want it to be. <br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T19:46:41-07:00","id":1082877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082869#post1082869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Same by the way with her name. It's fine if it's a secret in-setting, but that fact should be mentioned.</div> </div> </div> </div>Deep down inside, I believe her real name was always going to turn out to be something like &quot;Bertha&quot;. Everyone knows it, it is a matter of public record, but nobody dares say it and Miss SE refuses to answer to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T19:58:39-07:00","id":1082879,"title":"","content":"It's because they have the fire down below.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T20:29:50-07:00","id":1082882,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082879#post1082879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's because they have the fire down below.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Eating moldy bread can help with that, I hear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T20:59:42-07:00","id":1082889,"title":"","content":"At my own table I made her known name Rana, with the idea she abandoned her Gen name. The truth, which the public is unaware of, is her given name was Pasanu, and she was a bastard daughter of Gen Karmir born a mortal guard-woman, and raised by her father as an intelligence asset/torturer/assassin of the Gen unrecognized in her parentage. Her two legitimate half-siblings were among those who died in the Manse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T21:32:14-07:00","id":1082896,"title":"","content":"I never really thought about why the sub-title is the way it is... was too busy being glad the actual title of the book was the type of exalt detailed within, rather than that massively important piece of info being relegated to the sub-title following a long-winded and non-revealing title like <i>Book of Cool Stuff Special People can Do: Dragodudes</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Not so noble anymore.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1823-drake","name":"Drake","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1823_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"456"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T21:43:48-07:00","id":1082900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082871#post1082871\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My gathering is that it's a bit of customization. It's not a secret, but it's a detail that ultimately is irrelevant since she's gone and whatever you want it to be if you want it to be.<br /> <br /> And stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Precisely! The point of RPG supplements is to inspire the imagination of the players and to be useful to ST's not to just say every little thing so that you close off some perfectly valid storylines. Maybe it's relevant in your Chronicle that she's a water aspect. Maybe it's relevant that she's an Earth aspect, the RPG shouldn't say unless it's germain to the subject, or adds interest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T22:34:37-07:00","id":1082905,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082882#post1082882\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eating moldy bread can help with that, I hear.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pros: Cures some STIs.<br /> Cons: May cause you to burn your neighbors as witches.<br /> <br /> That seems fair.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T23:59:21-07:00","id":1082916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082905#post1082905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Pros: Cures some STIs.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Cons: May cause you to burn your neighbors as witches.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">That seems fair.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Depends on the type of mold.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wwhere</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082690#post1082690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They should just do four alternative cover versions, one for caste. What Fire has Wrought. What Water has Flood. What Air has Scattered. What Wood has Built. What Earth has Crushed</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this shows why it's 'What Fire has Wrought', as it's the easiest element to associate with human labour and refinement of humans into Dragons Bloods. Other elements aren't directly used as tools in the same ways as fire and thus lack some of it's dynamic semantic power. All the other elements just don't have such easily thought up subtitles with the same effect. Personally though, I think it should have been 'What the Dragons have Wrought' for thematic sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://jaxushomebrew.blogspot.ie/2016/06/introduction-site-map-and-catalogue.html\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew blog</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1291-mr-jaxus","name":"Mr.Jaxus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T00:14:47-07:00","id":1082924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082905#post1082905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Pros: Cures some STIs.<br /> Cons: May cause you to burn your neighbors as witches.<br /> <br /> That seems fair.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> PEDANTIC MAN: Hanged.... and in one case crushed. No one burned in Salem.<br /> <br /> ... I'll show myself out./Pedanctic Man AWAY!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T00:33:24-07:00","id":1082928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082869#post1082869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Same by the way with her name. It's fine if it's a secret in-setting, but that fact should be mentioned.</div> </div> </div> </div>Isn\u00b4t it obvious? Scarlet isn\u00b4t a title, it\u00b4s a name :P<br /> <br /> Or maybe it\u00b4s something like the Most High in Westeros: when you took upon the throne, title, you reject any name, surname or whatever. You ARE the title, the Empress, and that\u00b4s what you are: a personification of the state, the Empire, the Dragonblooded Host and the Will of the Dragons. At least publicly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth","name":"Clophiroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13031_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T01:15:22-07:00","id":1082941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082869#post1082869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Same by the way with her name. It's fine if it's a secret in-setting, but that fact should be mentioned.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, what was the birth name of the Hongwu Emperor?<br /> <br /> Or Tokugawa Ieyasu?<br /> <br /> \u200bJoseph Stalin?<br /> <br /> \u200bImperator Caesar Divi Filius Augustus?<br /> <br /> People always put far too much stock in the name thing, as though there haven't been innumerable rulers throughout history who go solely by assumed names or titles.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey teacher, what's the actual person name of the Scarlet Empress?&quot;<br /> \u200b&quot;Well, we could probably infer if we went looking for the characters and syllables in High Realm that have been rendered forbidden to even write, but if we do that the police will come looking for us.&quot;<br /> <br /> \u200b(Seriously, as late as the 18th century, writing a word whose pronunciation was the same as the given name of an emperor was the kind of offence that got you and your entire family executed)<br /> <br /> \u200bI don't think that the name of the Scarlet Empress was a secret so much as something that absolutely nobody in the world calls her anymore. I personally like to imagine that even in private conversation with her, Chejop Kejak addresses her with some kind of nickname, whereas to everybody else it's a title only because names are something shared amongst peers.<br /> <br /> \u200bDo you think Mnemon would keep letting anybody address her by that name if she ascended the throne?<br /> <br /> \u200bAs for the Aspect, it's my understanding that Grabowski deliberately mandated being coy about it to leave the possibility that she had done something weird to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T01:19:00-07:00","id":1082942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Drake</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082896#post1082896\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I never really thought about why the sub-title is the way it is... was too busy being glad the actual title of the book was the type of exalt detailed within, rather than that massively important piece of info being relegated to the sub-title following a long-winded and non-revealing title like <i>Book of Cool Stuff Special People can Do: Dragodudes</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThat's... wrong. It wasn't a subtitle, it was part of a main title that was constructed as &quot;category: specific subject&quot;. Hence how all of the other Exalted books were written like that, as well as quite a few of the supplements.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T04:43:16-07:00","id":1082966,"title":"","content":"Terrestrial: the Dynasty was probably a bit too close to what the rest of the family calls its books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T09:03:42-07:00","id":1083038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082941#post1082941\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bDo you think Mnemon would keep letting anybody address her by that name if she ascended the throne?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm pretty sure enough people in Creation literally crap themselves upon hearing her name that she would seriously consider keeping it. She'd demand a bunch of grandiose titles to try and sound even more terrifying than her mother, but I think she'd keep her name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T09:36:47-07:00","id":1083053,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure if anyone else has pointed this out, but the &quot;Fire&quot; could be a reference to the entirety of the history that the Dragon-Bloods have built, i.e., in the absence of Creation's &quot;true&quot; masters, Solars and other Celestials, the DBs had to harness their inner fire (guts, willpower, etc) and get shit done to keep the world from collapsing altogether.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5574,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5574-volatilesublime","user":"VolatileSublime","date":". 04-24-2017, 12:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5574-volatilesublime","name":"VolatileSublime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5574_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T10:18:11-07:00","id":1083073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082924#post1082924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> PEDANTIC MAN: Hanged.... and in one case crushed. No one burned in Salem.<br /> <br /> ... I'll show myself out./Pedanctic Man AWAY!</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, you're not a woman? Big if true.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T10:19:26-07:00","id":1083075,"title":"","content":"My take on the title of the Dragon-Blooded book is that for the past 1000+ years, Creation has belonged to the Dragon-Blooded. In that time, they forged two relatively strong, Creation spaning nations... the Shogunate that replaced the fallen Old Realm... and the current Realm that replaced the Shogunate.<br /> <br /> \u200bBoth of these civilizations were born in fire and ash... the Shogunate arising from the wreckage of the Old Realm following the Usurpation... while the current Realm rising from the ashes of the Shogunate after the twin catastrophes of the Great Contagion and the Fair Folk Invasion. Like the legendary phoenix, both would rise from the ash of what came before with a promise of new hope.<br /> <br /> \u200bIn the centuries that both lasted, the Dragon-Blooded had to fight hard to hold Creation together... this forged them into some of the greatest warriors the world has seen in their time... and over generations their legends grew to outshine even the feared Anathema (whose own heroics had been lost or altered over the centuries). The fires of war and adversity hardened the Dragon-Blooded into the heroes and villains they currently embody. Everything they have achieved... and they have achieved much... they had to fight for.<br /> <br /> \u200bThe Dragon-Blooded of the current setting have very much been forged into what they are... metaphorically at least. While the current Realm may be but a shadow of the one the Solars created, it is one that the Dragon-Blooded achieved on their own for the most part (and only guided by the hidden Sidereal)... as are the few other bastions of Dragon-Blooded around Creation. While many may have some remnants of the First Age artifice... most Dragon-Blooded rely on what they have made themselves... thus reinforcing the image that the Dragon-Blooded have been forged into what they are now by the fires of adversity they have overcome.<br /> <br /> \u200bFire may be but one of the five elements of Creation... but it is the one that causes the greatest transformation form what was... to what is. The Dragon-Blooded transformed themselves from being the mere foot soldiers in the armies of the Gods... to the Masters of Creation itself. None of the other Exalted can make such a grand claim... nor have any others risen so far from where they began.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T11:33:11-07:00","id":1083108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1083073#post1083073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait, you're not a woman? Big if true.</div> </div> </div> </div>Slightly complicated but in terms of external presentation I have cis male privilege so I feel uncomfortable labeling myself otherwise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T18:02:13-07:00","id":1083244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082941#post1082941\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> *snip*</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not asking for confirmation on what her birth name is. I'm asking what the people of the Realm know. If she's expunged it and they know this and are only allowed to call her the Scarlet Empress - that's fine. I just want to know that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u200bAs for the Aspect, it's my understanding that Grabowski deliberately mandated being coy about it to leave the possibility that she had done something weird to it. </div> </div> </div>Which is fine, I just want to know what common knowledge among Dynast PCs would be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T00:34:27-07:00","id":1083376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1083244#post1083244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm asking what the people of the Realm know. If she's expunged it</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you think the Realm has freedom of information?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">are only allowed to call her the Scarlet Empress - that's fine. I just want to know that.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bIt seems to me to be something naturally inferred.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T15:51:16-07:00","id":1083729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1083376#post1083376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Do you think the Realm has freedom of information?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>No, but is that a deliberate effort or a side effect of limited education and communication channels? And how strongly would such efforts or circumstances affect the different social strata?<br /> <br /> The Scarlet Empress is, or claims to be, a dragonblood. It is common knowledge among the dynasts that dragonbloods are exalted of one element (or at least nothing says it wouldn't be). That means that either the (true or assumed) aspect of the Empress would be known, or it would be known that it is a secret (which would likely draw curiosity). Which of these it is sounds like a reasonably important piece of setting information. Same for her name.<br /> <br /> It's fine not to tell the readers of the books. But it should be clear whether this information is withheld to allow for the ST to set it themselves while not being an in-setting secret, or whether it is an in-setting secret as well. If it is an in-setting secret, how she is hiding it and how far others are willing to go to uncover it make can make for compelling story points.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I thank the Devs for the great game of Exalted!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded","name":"BjornTheFellhanded","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12735_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"327"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T16:23:58-07:00","id":1083743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BjornTheFellhanded</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1083729#post1083729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">is that a deliberate effort</div> </div> </div> </div>This still sounds like something that assumes record keeping and historiography familiar to us. I don't think it's a &quot;deliberate effort&quot; so much as it being a simple matter of nobody ever writing an official biography of the Scarlet Empress, and nobody expecting there to be. It's not an omission or a failure of education if the culture does not even begin with the assumption that you talk about your monarchs as though they're people<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BjornTheFellhanded</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Scarlet Empress is, or claims to be, a dragonblood. It is common knowledge among the dynasts that dragonbloods are exalted of one element<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Aspect is a horse of a different colour.<br /> <br /> \u200bI assume that most Dynasts think that there's something weird going on with that part of the Empress, since she's a powerful sorceress bonded to ancient weaponry, and it's in everybody's best interests to not look too closely.<br /> <br /> \u200bWhen it comes to the question of whether or not it's a secret, I come down squarely on the side of it not being important. It's not exactly a difficult thing to come up with an answer for, and most people who bring it up already seem to have their own answers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T18:02:32-07:00","id":1083767,"title":"","content":"We don't live in a society even remotely like the Realm. In our society not knowing Trump's or Putin's first name or ethnicity would be weird. If not knowing the Empress' name or aspect is not weird, then that might need pointing out. Otherwise everyone is just going to make assumptions.<br /> <br /> For example, we have different people coming to different assumptions as to how important the secrecy of her name and aspect are.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I thank the Devs for the great game of Exalted!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded","name":"BjornTheFellhanded","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12735_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"327"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T18:07:35-07:00","id":1083771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BjornTheFellhanded</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1083767#post1083767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...<br /> For example, we have different people coming to different assumptions as to how important the secrecy of her name and aspect are.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is arguably a feature, not a bug.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T19:04:25-07:00","id":1083779,"title":"","content":"I figured it was more purple prose from the guys who filled a giant-ass core book with the stuff. *Shrug*<br /> <br /> It's definitely better than Manual of Exalted Power: the &lt;insert splat here&gt;; I'll give it that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6601-totentanz","name":"Totentanz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T19:20:31-07:00","id":1083785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1082924#post1082924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">PEDANTIC MAN: Hanged.... and in one case crushed. No one burned in Salem.</div> </div> </div> </div>In Salem, Massachusetts, no. <br /> <br /> Back over in Europe, though, <i>lots</i> of people were burned for heresy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/572-verzio","name":"Verzio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar572_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T19:34:27-07:00","id":1083787,"title":"","content":"Given how Dragon Blooded Exaltation is passed maybe a better title would be &quot;What WOOD Has Wrought&quot;?<br /> <br /> *I know bad joke is bad... I still smirked though :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T19:57:38-07:00","id":1083790,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Verzio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1083785#post1083785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In Salem, Massachusetts, no. <br /> <br /> Back over in Europe, though, <i>lots</i> of people were burned for heresy.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, but the elliciting reference was to ergot, which is a theory about what happened in Salem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T22:38:35-07:00","id":1083857,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1083790#post1083790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> True, but the elliciting reference was to ergot, which is a theory about what happened in Salem.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penicillium\" target=\"_blank\">Well, not quite.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T22:51:01-07:00","id":1083866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1083857#post1083857\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penicillium\" target=\"_blank\">Well, not quite.</a></div> </div> </div> </div>*sigh*<br /> <br /> I know that. This was the comment I was responding to: <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Pros: Cures some STIs.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Cons: May cause you to burn your neighbors as witches.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">That seems fair.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">In reference to &quot;eating moldy bread&quot;. The &quot;Pro&quot; is a reference to penicillium. The &quot;Con&quot; is a reference to the ergot theory about Salem. Are we all on the same page now?</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-26-2017, 02:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T22:57:55-07:00","id":1083869,"title":"","content":"In East Asia, people (usually male) coming-of-age will take a new name for themselves, they will use this name for most social situation, only relative and really close friend can call a person by their birth name. Kings and emperors also adopts a bunch of new names/titles when they take the throne, Wu Zetian and Qin Shi Huang, for example, are not their real birth name, but name they took when became emperor.<br /> <br /> Since I watched historical dramas and people keeps referring to the emperor using the title name, so not knowing Scarlet's real birth name doesn't bother me that much.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T23:17:20-07:00","id":1083873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1082625-why-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-as-the-title?p=1083376#post1083376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Do you think the Realm has freedom of information?</div> </div> </div> </div>No and I don't believe I said anything indicating I did think that. I said I wanted to know what the people of the Realm knew/believed, even if said belief is a lie. I'm not arguing they should necessarily know the truth, whatever it may be.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-26T01:10:01-07:00","id":1083889,"title":"","content":"I think this is a case in which it's better to simply depict the thing rather than include commentary on what is being depicted.<br /> <br /> \u200bIf she is only ever called the Scarlet Empress, and character points of view only ever call her the Scarlet Empress, the question of whether or not anybody knows her by any other name seems to have been answered rather organically.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-26T01:34:14-07:00","id":1083895,"title":"","content":"It's a horrible and pretentious subtitle and I cringe every time I see it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Map of Third Edition Creation in a First Edition Style<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/media?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpreview.redd.it%2F18ttip13xdsc1.png%3Fwidth%3D5780%26format%3Dpng%26auto%3Dwebp%26s%3D35f3d332551385032587cde8b093e4923ed687ee\" target=\"_blank\">\u200b</a>, (<a href